# Git flow

Follow `docs/workflow.md`.

- New feature: branch `feat/<slug>` from `dev`.
- Bug fix: branch `hotfix/<slug>` from `dev`.
- Do not commit directly on `dev` or `main`.
- When the user says sign-off or approve: push the current `feat/*` or `hotfix/*` branch, open a pull request into `dev`, and stop. The user merges.
- When the user says promote: open a pull request from `dev` into `main`, and stop. The user merges. Sign-off never targets `main`.
